====Usage notes====
* At the beginning of {{w|Angela Merkel|Angela Merkel's}} tenure in 2005, this form was still considered doubtful. Some preferred the masculine form and the address {{m|de||Frau Bundeskanzler}}. However, it soon established itself fully and also became official.

